6","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Greg Lehmkuhl","x":"And regardless of what happens with policy or tariffs, we feel extremely well positioned to support the global food supply chain.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/06/lineage-line-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LINE 2024 Q3","e":"line","d":"2024-11-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Ronald Kamden","x":"As the market sort of is thinking about next year, and you take a step back on the Lineage platform, can you talk about your ability to have pricing power in an environment where, again, demand is maybe stable and customers are still rationalizing inventory?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/06/lineage-line-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LINE 2024 Q3","e":"line","d":"2024-11-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Nick Thillman","x":"[Inaudible] down year on year in 3Q and I guess maybe part of that could be power related savings that you couldn't pass through or the customer can achieve some goal on that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/06/lineage-line-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LINE 2024 Q3","e":"line","d":"2024-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Greg Lehmkuhl","x":"We're working with the C-level and their executive leadership teams to help them streamline their supply chains and best position their inventory around the world.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/06/lineage-line-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LINE 2024 Q3","e":"line","d":"2024-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Caitlin Burrows","x":"I was more wondering on like a best-in-class Hazleton-type location versus a traditional-type property you have, and trying to figure out more from how much labor cost savings there could be from automation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/06/lineage-line-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c"