this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/lineage-line-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LINE 2026 Q1","e":"line","d":"2026-05-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robb LeMasters","x":"This is not simply a cost reduction exercise.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/lineage-line-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LINE 2026 Q1","e":"line","d":"2026-05-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Greg Lehmkuhl","x":"We are maintaining our 2026 guidance as we continue to expect annual same-store NOI contraction of negative 4% to negative 1% and AFFO of $2.75 to $3 per share.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/lineage-line-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LINE 2026 Q1","e":"line","d":"2026-05-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Robb LeMasters","x":"We are reiterating our 2026 guidance with same-store NOI growth of minus 4% to minus 1%, total warehouse NOI growth of minus 2% to plus 1%, GIS NOI growth of 0% to 2%, adjusted EBITDA in the range of $1.25 billion to $1.30 billion and AFFO in the range of $2.75 to $3 per share.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/lineage-line-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LINE 2026 Q2","e":"line","d":"2026-08-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"W. Lehmkuhl","x":"Finally, our third headwind is import-export volumes pulling back on the tariff uncertainty.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/lineage-line-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LINE 2026 Q2","e":"line","d":"2026-08-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"W. Lehmkuhl","x":"Beyond tariff resolution, there are several upside factors not embedded in our guidance, normalizing food inflation, easing political uncertainty, new product categories and lower interest rates, any of which could meaningfully move the needle over time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/lineage-line-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LINE 2026 Q2","e":"line","d":"2026-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robb LeMasters","x":"First, accelerating truckload and LTL carrier rates, which we passed through to customers, but at a lag, created near-term pressure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/lineage-line-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LINE 2026 Q2","e":"line","d":"2026-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robb LeMasters","x":"That's generally a pass-through, but that's come through slightly better than we thought.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/lineage-line-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LINE 2026 Q2","e":"line","d":"2026-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robb LeMasters","x":"And Greg talked about that you try to offset that with the cost savings initiatives, but you're fighting inflation, right?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/lineage-line-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LINE 2026 Q2","e":"line","d":"2026-08-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Robb LeMasters","x":"So as we made a comment, we're lowering our guidance generally from the $7 million settlement and a little bit of softness related to that carrier issue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/lineage-line-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LINE 2026 Q3","e":"line","d":"2026-11-10","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"W. Lehmkuhl","x":"At the same time, we're leveraging our investments in technology, automation and AI to drive productivity and efficiency across our global network.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/lineage-line-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LINE 2026 Q3","e":"line","d":"2026-11-10","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"W. Lehmkuhl","x":"First, as you can see on the chart at the top of the page, Lineage same-store container volumes began to march down following the April 2025 tariff announcements.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/lineage-line-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LINE 2026 Q3","e":"line","d":"2026-11-10","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"W. Lehmkuhl","x":"Early this year, the industry appeared to be adjusting to the impacts of the tariff announcements, but trends in the late summer and early fall suggested that recovery could be delayed.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/lineage-line-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LINE 2026 Q3","e":"line","d":"2026-11-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"W. Lehmkuhl","x":"Next is just achieving closer to inflationary level price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/lineage-line-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LINE 2026 Q3","e":"line","d":"2026-11-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"W. Lehmkuhl","x":"We are seeing more pricing power in markets that recovered, as you alluded to, and the pricing that we're winning business back at is comparable to the existing rates in those markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/lineage-line-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LINE 2026 Q3","e":"line","d":"2026-11-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robb LeMasters","x":"That said, our $50 million cost takeout effort is ahead of schedule, and we expect to realize a greater portion of that within 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/lineage-line-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LINE 2026 Q3","e":"line","d":"2026-11-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robb LeMasters","x":"Our $50 million cost reduction plan is ahead of schedule, and we expect to realize a greater portion of that within 2026, as I mentioned.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/lineage-line-q3-2026-earnings-cal